                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyowe Yesu, nkutumiire malaika wange akumanyise binu, nukwo bigasire ebitebe by'abaikiriza. Ninyowe kikoro kandi mwijukuru ow'oruganda rwa Daudi, enyunyuuzi erukwangasana ey'omu rukyakya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
